      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I believe while they do not currently have an active way to send a notification, they already have something that can be triggered upon an update of the game. They have the notification screen that looks like the loading screen. For some stupid reason they did not use it for this update, and well have not been using it to alert people of changes or updates like they probably should be.\n\nWith the notification changes being tested now it would be more likely that they can have a proper notification system that can be triggered at anytime if they ever wanted to.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "5ca22a9fe939ac736b7652d0",
