      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "yes I would definitely like this especially because many people even who are in the Discord just don't read the updates or whatever. recently after they added the dynamic bone limiter it was about four days of constantly telling everyone in a bunch of various VRC related Discord servers that their Dynamic bones aren't broken and they just need to turn off the system because very few people knew it was implemented. \n\nmany people don't care enough to read the patch notes so a little in-game notification especially about things that will significantly impact players such as that would be nice. they sent out game by notifications before if on accident so clearly the system is somewhat in place. I don't think it would be too hard to push through a notification informing players that there is now a dynamic bone limiter for example and how to access it",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
