      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Why are they and others so insistent on trying to force me to go to discord? I don't want to interact with the dev people or their circle jerk ERP harems, their modern behaviors seriously disappoint me and I want as far from them as possible, discord closes this distance forcibly, I don't wish to read any of their text or acknowledge their existence. They used to be fun to hang out with in 2017-2018 for a short period but they all fell off and show no signs of improving. The rumors you hear about them, none of them are ever good.",
